<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian Adria to restart flights to Dubrovnik.</title>
<headline>Slovenian Adria to restart flights to Dubrovnik.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenia's only airline Adria Airways said on Wednesday it planned to restart flights to Dubrovnik in Croatia from December 17.</p>
<p>A 48-seat de Havilland Dash 7 will make the return flight from Ljubljana to Dubrovnik each Tuesday, the firm said.</p>
<p>War interrupted international flights to Croatia in 1991.</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
